{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：16:22 2026-11-10 HKT<br/>發佈時間：16:22 2026-11-10 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：16:22 2026-11-10 HKT</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/83579116f29f2759b1389e24770ccecb/2026-11/001_3.png\"/><p>西灣河發生工業意外。今日（10日）下午2時許，一名60多歲男工人於太康街1號地下操作期機器期間意外割傷手掌，傷口長達10厘米，血流如注，幸仍然清醒，由救護車送往東區醫院治理，警方正調查意外原因。</p><img alt=\"男工人手掌被機器割傷，清醒送院。曾志恒攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4839b3793e1c03c99b2f408d7b9215a4/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-10_at_15_55_17.jpeg\" title=\"男工人手掌被機器割傷，清醒送院。曾志恒攝\"/><p>男工人手掌被機器割傷，清醒送院。曾志恒攝</p>\n<p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.008078+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":201,"images":2,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T08:22:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T13:55:14.213234+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:59.058305+00:00","content_hash":"618f47c77247fac32a6a75799778d1640f4937034e6e35af8a2a256cf8814565","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}